<a href="#S3.SS2.p1.1" title="3.2 IP-Adapter and PuLID ‣ 3 Revisit Text-to-Image Diffusion Models ‣ CaricHarmony: Contrastive Diffusion Paths for Identity-Preserving Caricature Synthesis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§3.2</span></a>.
</span></li>
</ul>
</section>
<section id="Sx1" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section">Supplementary Material for
<br class="ltx_break ltx_centering" style="--ltx-break-space:3.0pt;">
<span id="Sx1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_align_center">CaricHarmony: Contrastive Diffusion Paths for Identity-Preserving Caricature Synthesis</span></h2>

</section>
<section id="Sx2" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section">A. Algorithm</h2>

<div id="Sx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The steps of our proposed method are summarized in Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ A. Algorithm ‣ CaricHarmony: Contrastive Diffusion Paths for Identity-Preserving Caricature Synthesis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> for clarity. We use DDIM sampler as an example for simplicity, but it is straightforward to replace it with the DPM++ 2M sampler <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib33" title="" class="ltx_ref">26</a>]</cite>. <math id="Sx2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\alpha}_{t}=\prod_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\alpha}_{t}=\prod_{i=1}^{t}\alpha_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is the cumulative product of the noise schedule <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib12" title="" class="ltx_ref">16</a>]</cite>. It is worth mentioning that, at each time-step, the energy functions should be computed across all the cross-attention blocks and subsequently summed.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> CaricHarmony</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Require:</span> UNET denoiser <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon_{\theta}(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon_{\theta}(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math>; CLIP-T model <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math>; Word embedding layer <math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{W}(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{W}(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math>; Text prompts <math id="alg1.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math>; Binary sketch image <math id="alg1.l1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math>; Identity image <math id="alg1.l1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>I</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I</annotation></semantics></math>; Classifier-free guidance scale <math id="alg1.l1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math>; Guidance rate <math id="alg1.l1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>η</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta</annotation></semantics></math>; VAE decoder <math id="alg1.l1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Initialization:</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           Sample latent noise <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{z}_{T}=\hat{z}_{T}^{\mathrm{i}}=\hat{z}_{T}^{\mathrm{s}}\sim\mathcal{N}(0,\mathbf{I})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>T</mi><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐈</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{z}_{T}=\hat{z}_{T}^{\mathrm{i}}=\hat{z}_{T}^{\mathrm{s}}\sim\mathcal{N}(0,\mathbf{I})</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           Obtain text conditions <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{\mathrm{txt}}\leftarrow\mathcal{T}(\mathcal{W}(p))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>txt</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{\mathrm{txt}}\leftarrow\mathcal{T}(\mathcal{W}(p))</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           Obtain ID conditions <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{\mathrm{id}}\leftarrow PuLID(I)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>id</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{\mathrm{id}}\leftarrow PuLID(I)</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           Obtain shape conditions <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{\mathrm{s}}\leftarrow Adapter(S)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{\mathrm{s}}\leftarrow Adapter(S)</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           Set joint condition <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{\mathrm{e}}\leftarrow[C_{\mathrm{txt}},C_{\mathrm{id}},C_{\mathrm{s}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>txt</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>id</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{\mathrm{e}}\leftarrow[C_{\mathrm{txt}},C_{\mathrm{id}},C_{\mathrm{s}}]</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=T</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">to</span> <math id="alg1.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{b}}\leftarrow 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{b}}\leftarrow 0</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\epsilon}_{t}\leftarrow(1+\gamma)\,\epsilon_{\theta}(\hat{z}_{t},t,C_{\mathrm{e}})-\gamma\,\epsilon_{\theta}(\hat{z}_{t},t,\emptyset)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\epsilon}_{t}\leftarrow(1+\gamma)\,\epsilon_{\theta}(\hat{z}_{t},t,C_{\mathrm{e}})-\gamma\,\epsilon_{\theta}(\hat{z}_{t},t,\emptyset)</annotation></semantics></math>
{Classifier-Free Guidance}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            Cache intermediate features <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg1.l11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K_{\mathrm{txt}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>txt</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K_{\mathrm{txt}}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg1.l11.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>V</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="alg1.l11.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>O</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O</annotation></semantics></math> derived from <math id="alg1.l11.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon_{\theta}(\hat{z}_{t},t,C_{\mathrm{e}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon_{\theta}(\hat{z}_{t},t,C_{\mathrm{e}})</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{\mathrm{start}}^{\mathrm{s}}&gt;t&gt;t_{\mathrm{end}}^{\mathrm{s}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>start</mi><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>end</mi><mi>s</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{\mathrm{start}}^{\mathrm{s}}&gt;t&gt;t_{\mathrm{end}}^{\mathrm{s}}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
             <math id="alg1.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{z}_{t-1}^{\mathrm{s}},Q^{\mathrm{s}}\leftarrow DDIMSamplingStep(\hat{z}_{t}^{\mathrm{s}},C_{\mathrm{s}},C_{\mathrm{txt}},\epsilon_{\theta}(\cdot),\gamma)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mi>s</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>M</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>txt</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{z}_{t-1}^{\mathrm{s}},Q^{\mathrm{s}}\leftarrow DDIMSamplingStep(\hat{z}_{t}^{\mathrm{s}},C_{\mathrm{s}},C_{\mathrm{txt}},\epsilon_{\theta}(\cdot),\gamma)</annotation></semantics></math>
{A sampling step with Classifier-Free Guidance}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
             <math id="alg1.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{layout}},\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{sem}}\leftarrow ComputeShapeEnergy(Q,Q^{\mathrm{s}},K_{\mathrm{txt}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>layout</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>sem</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mi>s</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>txt</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{layout}},\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{sem}}\leftarrow ComputeShapeEnergy(Q,Q^{\mathrm{s}},K_{\mathrm{txt}})</annotation></semantics></math>
{Equation (3) and Equation (4)}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
             <math id="alg1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{b}}\leftarrow\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{b}}+\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{layout}}+\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{sem}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>layout</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>sem</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{b}}\leftarrow\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{b}}+\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{layout}}+\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{sem}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l16.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l17.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg1.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{\mathrm{start}}^{\mathrm{i}}&gt;t&gt;t_{\mathrm{end}}^{\mathrm{i}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>start</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>end</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{\mathrm{start}}^{\mathrm{i}}&gt;t&gt;t_{\mathrm{end}}^{\mathrm{i}}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l17.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
             <math id="alg1.l18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{z}_{t-1}^{\mathrm{i}},[Q^{\mathrm{i}},O^{\mathrm{i}}]\leftarrow DDIMSamplingStep(\hat{z}_{t}^{\mathrm{i}},C_{\mathrm{id}},C_{\mathrm{txt}},\epsilon_{\theta}(\cdot),\gamma)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>O</mi><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>M</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>id</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>txt</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{z}_{t-1}^{\mathrm{i}},[Q^{\mathrm{i}},O^{\mathrm{i}}]\leftarrow DDIMSamplingStep(\hat{z}_{t}^{\mathrm{i}},C_{\mathrm{id}},C_{\mathrm{txt}},\epsilon_{\theta}(\cdot),\gamma)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
             <math id="alg1.l19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{id}}\leftarrow ComputeIDEnergy(Q,O,Q^{\mathrm{i}},O^{\mathrm{i}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>id</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>I</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>O</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>O</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{id}}\leftarrow ComputeIDEnergy(Q,O,Q^{\mathrm{i}},O^{\mathrm{i}})</annotation></semantics></math>
{Equation (7)}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
             <math id="alg1.l20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{b}}\leftarrow\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{b}}+\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{id}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>id</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{b}}\leftarrow\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{b}}+\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{id}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l21.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l22" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l22.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg1.l22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{b}}\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{b}}\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l22.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l23" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
             <math id="alg1.l23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\epsilon}_{t}\leftarrow\hat{\epsilon}_{t}+\eta\nabla_{\hat{z}_{t}}\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{b}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\epsilon}_{t}\leftarrow\hat{\epsilon}_{t}+\eta\nabla_{\hat{z}_{t}}\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{b}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
